{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Hard Work","html":"<article id='sn53.23-34'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 53.23 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 53.23–34 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>3. Balakaraṇīyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>3. Hard Work </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Balakaraṇīyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hard Work </span></h1></header>\n<p class='expansion-instructions'><span class='root'>(Balakaraṇīyavaggo vitthāretabbo.) </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>(Tell in full as in the chapter on hard work at SN 45.149–160.) </span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Balaṁ bījañca nāgo ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hard work, seeds, and dragons, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>rukkho kumbhena sūkiyā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>a tree, a pot, and a spike, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ākāsena ca dve meghā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the atmosphere, and two on clouds, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>nāvā āgantukā nadīti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>a ship, a guest house, and a river. </span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
